{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":64,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["願你裂天而降，",{"text":"願群山在你面前顫抖，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使敵人認識你的威名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列國在你面前顫抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如火燒乾柴使水沸騰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾降臨，行超乎我們預料的可畏之事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時群山在你面前顫抖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自古以來，人耳未曾聽聞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人眼也未曾見過除你之外的任何神明為信奉者行奇事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你眷顧樂於行義、遵行你旨意的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們不斷地犯罪惹你發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們怎能得救呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們都像污穢的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的義行不過像染了經血的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們如葉子漸漸枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的罪惡如風一樣把我們吹去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人呼求你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人緊緊依靠你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你掩面不理我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們在自己的罪中滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"但耶和華啊，你是我們的父親。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們是陶泥，你是窯匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們都是你親手所造的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你不要大發烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要永遠記著我們的罪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們都是你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂顧我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眾聖城已淪為荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安已淪為荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷已淪為廢墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們那聖潔、華美的殿，就是我們祖先頌讚你的地方已被焚毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們珍愛的一切都被摧毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你對這些事怎能坐視不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你仍然保持緘默，並重重地懲罰我們嗎？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/64.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/65.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/63.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}